  "description": {
   "en": "Nitori Akari is an early riser. As a 1st-year high school student, she had a secret—something she carried out alone in the empty classroom about 30 minutes before school started. The secret, burdened with the girl's modest feeling of control and feeling of guilty pleasure, was supposed to remain undisturbed by anyone…",
   "ja": "似鳥 明(にとり あかり)は早起きだ。高校１年生の私には、放課前の約３０分間、誰もいない教室で行う、秘密があった。少女の抱えるささやかな支配感と背徳感のある秘密は、誰にも邪魔されないはずだった…"
  },
